abstract: >-
  A claim-separated research workspace for associative scan algebra,
  equivariant identification, structured memory, triality and Clifford
  dynamics, information geometry, rotor and noncommutative state-space models,
  finite subgroup branching, and a standalone Collatz programme.
keywords:
  - state-space models
  - associative scans
  - geometric algebra
  - Spin groups
  - triality
  - structured memory
  - information geometry
